269 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (As part of Maitri Ninaad, Maitri's podcast series, Rajrani Sharma, a Maitri member pursuing BCA at Eternal University, Himachal Pradesh, through NavGurukul Foundation, joined Maitri lead Bhavya Maurya for a conversation on The Power of a Role Model. The episode explored Rajrani's journey of navigating family expectations, self-doubt, ambition and the challenges of pursuing a career in technology in an unfamiliar place, far from home. Her experiences highlighted how access to opportunities, sustained support, and belief can enable young women to challenge limitations and pursue their aspirations with confidence. Through this conversation, Maitri also created a space for its members to share their journeys, inspire one another, and recognise that role models can emerge from within their own communities.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
